# Default: restore the data committed with this branch; no external input delivery.
HILLINK_PORT=8994
# Optional: change only the location of the derived data cache.
# HILLINK_DATA_HOME=/absolute/path/to/cache
# Optional: a newly reviewed registry generated by persona_pipeline register.
# HILLINK_ISOLATED_REGISTRY=/absolute/private/registry.json
# HILLINK_ISOLATED_REGISTRY_SHA256=<verified-sha256>
# Approved LIVE_RESPONSES cache only; bundled rule-run JSON files are not an LLM cache.
# HILLINK_AGENT_CACHE=/absolute/private/approved-agent-cache
# Actual API keys and authentication credentials must not be committed.
# A separately approved live integration uses OPENAI_API_KEY, HILLINK_AGENT_MODEL,
# HILLINK_AGENT_BUDGET_FILE, HILLINK_AGENT_MAX_USD, HILLINK_AGENT_MAX_CALLS.
# Default startup uses exact Replay and blocks outbound Python sockets.
# Explicitly approved live startup: bash tools/start_product.sh --live
# HILLINK_LIVE_APPROVAL_REFERENCE=<approved-scope>
# HILLINK_AGENT_BUDGET_FILE=/absolute/path/to/existing/usage.private.json
# HILLINK_AGENT_MAX_CALLS=2500
# HILLINK_AGENT_MAX_USD=20
